<html lang="ar" dir="ltr">
<body style="direction: ltr;">
<div class="container mt-4">
    <div class="row align-items-center">
            <div class="col-6 text-start">
                <img src="~/images/moh-logo.png" alt="Ministry of Health" style="height: 60px; width: auto;" />
            </div>
    <nav aria-label="breadcrumb">
        <ol class="breadcrumb" style="border: 1px solid #ccc; /* حدود رمادية */
                              border-radius: 5px;      /* حواف مدورة */
                              padding: 10px 15px;      /* مسافة داخلية */
                              background-color: #e0e0e0;">
            <li class="breadcrumb-item"><a href="#">MOH Portal</a></li>
            <li class="breadcrumb-item"><a href="#">E-Services</a></li>
            <li class="breadcrumb-item active">Regulatory Healthcare Sandbox</li>
        </ol>
    </nav>

    <div class="row">
        <div class="col-md-8">    

           <div style="background-color: #f5f0e6;
           border: 2px solid #a67c52;
           border-radius: 10px;
           padding: 20px;
           max-width: 1000px;
           margin: 20px auto;">

                <h1 class="text-success mb-4">Regulatory Healthcare Sandbox</h1>

                <div class="mb-3">
                    <span class="badge bg-light text-dark border">Minstry</span>
                    <span class="badge bg-light text-dark border">Related paltforms</span>
                </div>

                <p class="text-muted leading-relaxed" style="color: #4b3b2a; /* بني غامق للنص */ font-size:16px; line-height:1.6;">
                    The Ministry of Health Sandbox e-service is provided through an integrated digital platform that allows innovators and developers to benefit from a safe experimental environment remotely, without the need to visit the entity headquarters. Beneficiaries can access all advisory and logistical services, in addition to training and guidance, through an electronic platform that facilitates communication and knowledge exchange, which contributes to supporting health innovations and transforming ideas into reality efficiently and quickly.
                To view the steps of service, <a href="https://youtu.be/Nw_IAp7fLH8?si=wsqIq0u7DVERMZFP" target="_blank" style="color:#19692c; font-weight:bold; text-decoration:underline;">
        Click here.</a>

                </p>

                <div>
                    <a type="submit" class="btn"
                            style="background-color: white;
                   color: #19692c;
                   border: 2px solid #19692c;
                   font-weight: bold;"
                   asp-area="Customer" asp-controller="User" asp-action="Index">
                        Request Permit
                    </a>
                </div>

            </div>

            <style>
    /* فقط نص الـ active tab باللون الأخضر */
    .custom-tabs .nav-link.active {
        color: #19692c !important; /* أخضر */
    }
</style>
            <ul class="nav nav-tabs custom-tabs" id="myTab" role="tablist">
                <li class="nav-item" role="presentation">
                    <button class="nav-link active" id="steps-tab" data-bs-toggle="tab" data-bs-target="#steps" type="button" role="tab">STEPS</button>
                </li>
                <li class="nav-item" role="presentation">
                    <button class="nav-link" id="eligibility-tab" data-bs-toggle="tab" data-bs-target="#eligibility" type="button" role="tab">ELIGIBILITY</button>
                </li>
                <li class="nav-item" role="presentation">
                    <button class="nav-link" id="required-tab" data-bs-toggle="tab" data-bs-target="#required" type="button" role="tab">REQUIRED INFORMATION</button>
                </li>
            </ul>

            <div class="tab-content border border-top-0 p-4 rounded-bottom mb-4" id="myTabContent">
                <div class="tab-pane fade show active" id="steps" role="tabpanel">
                    <ul class="steps-list">
                        <li>From the official Ministry of Health website, click on the "E-Services" menu, then select the card of "Regulatory HealthCare Sandbox"</li>
                        <li>Click on ( Request permit )</li>
                        <li>You will see this page, from there; enter your email and verification code.</li>
                        <li>After registering and clicking "Next," send the verification code to the attached email. Enter the verification code.</li>
                        <li>
                            After clicking 'Next,' you will be logged into the digital solutions platform. At the top, you will see the search box. If you have previously attached a solution and want to follow up on it, you need to fill in its details.
                        </li>
                        <li>If this is your first visit to the platform or if you want to add a new request, you need to click on 'New Request.</li>
                        <li>
                            After that, you will be redirected to the next page, and you need to read the terms for submitting the request. If you agree with the terms, click on 'Agree.' Upon clicking 'Agree,' a box will appear at the bottom for selecting the type of registration, whether the applicant is a company or an individual. After selecting, click on 'Next.
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            You will be directed to a data entry page based on your registration type, and you must complete it fully :
                            For individuals
                            For companies​
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            After completing the registration information, you need to provide complete details about your innovation and answer all the questions.
                       </li>
                       <li>Once you have filled in all the fields, attach a PDF file of your innovation, then click on 'Save' to submit your request.</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
                <div class="tab-pane fade" id="eligibility" role="tabpanel">
                    <p>Details about eligibility go here...</p>
                </div>
                <div class="tab-pane fade" id="required" role="tabpanel">
                    <p>Information required for application goes here...</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="col-md-4">
                <div style="background-color: #f5f0e6;
           border: 2px solid #a67c52;
           border-radius: 10px;
           padding: 60px;
           max-width: 1000px;
           margin: 20px auto;">

                <div class="d-flex align-items-center mb-3">
                    <i class="bi bi-people fs-4 text-success me-3"></i>
                    <div>
                        <strong>Business, citizen, Companies</strong><br>
                        <small class="text-muted">Target audience</small>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <hr>
                <div class="d-flex align-items-center mb-3">
                    <i class="bi bi-clock fs-4 text-success me-3"></i>
                    <div>
                        <strong>10 workdays</strong><br>
                        <small class="text-muted">Service duration</small>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <hr>
                <div class="d-flex align-items-center mb-3">
                    <i class="bi bi-laptop fs-4 text-success me-3"></i>
                    <div>
                        <strong>Website Portal</strong><br>
                        <small class="text-muted">Service channels</small>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <hr>
                <div class="d-flex align-items-center mb-3">
                    <i class="bi bi-cash-stack fs-4 text-success me-3"></i>
                    <div><strong>Free</strong><br><small class="text-muted">Service cost</small></div>
                </div>
                <hr>
                <div class="d-flex align-items-center mb-3">
                    <i class="bi bi-translate fs-4 text-success me-3"></i>
                    <div><strong>Arabic / English</strong><br><small class="text-muted">Service language</small></div>
                </div>
                <hr>

                <h6 class="mt-4 fw-bold gold-text">Frequently Asked Questions</h6>
                <a href="#" class="btn btn-outline-success btn-sm w-100 mt-2">Ministry-FAQ's-page</a>

                <h6 class="mt-4 fw-bold gold-text">Customer support</h6>
                <div class="mt-2 small">
                    <div class="mb-2 text-muted"><i class="bi bi-telephone text-success me-2"></i> Phone</div>
                    <div class="mb-2 text-muted"><i class="bi bi-envelope text-success me-2"></i> SVH-Sandbox@moh.gov.sa</div>
                    <div class="mb-2 text-muted"><i class="bi bi-globe text-success me-2"></i> www.moh.gov.sa</div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
</div>
</body>
</html>